    {
      "name": "Canarias Flavor Pack",
      "date": "dec. 2025 - now",
      "skills": "CK3, YAML",
      "description": "Canarias Flavor Pack is a mod for CK3 focused on the historical and cultural representation of the indigenous peoples and their traditions in the Canary Islands. An effort has been made to represent the islands as faithfully as possible, based on historical sources or plausible assumptions.\n",
